WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.400
Pack the tiles into a rectangle. The two sides give the two brackets.

2
00:00:05.426 --> 00:00:09.176
Pack x squared plus five x plus six into a rectangle.

3
00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:13.680
One and six multiply to six, but add to seven.

4
00:00:16.614 --> 00:00:19.864
Two and three multiply to six and add to five.
